  - '* Is it like a water flower\n  or something?'
  - '* HEY!!!^05\n* IT COPIED ME!!!'
  - '* I think I know\n  what this is.'
  - '* It''s called an Echo\n  Flower.'
  - '* They grow in marsh areas,^05\n  and I think they''re\n  adverse to sunlight...?'
  - '* So they''re pretty\n  rare in our world.'
  - '* They''re infamous for\n  constantly repeating any\n  sound it hears.'
  - '* (It''s...^05 really freaky.)'
  - '* Well it''s a good\n  thing we don''t live\n  near a swamp,^05 faha!'
